<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">While standard vehicle insurance covers accidents, it typically does not cover damage that occurs while the bike is being transported in a truck.</p>
